WEBVTT

00:04:59.420 --> 00:05:00.963
I need you to hold that feeling.

00:05:00.963 --> 00:05:02.798
Please hold that feeling,

00:05:02.798 --> 00:05:05.134
but also chase that feeling,

00:05:05.134 --> 00:05:07.720
because what good
is our power and success,

00:05:07.720 --> 00:05:10.056
what use is it making it to the top

00:05:10.056 --> 00:05:14.435
if all it affords us is a bird’s-eye view
of everyone we’ve left behind?

00:05:16.020 --> 00:05:17.938
If your journey in inclusion feels easy,

00:05:17.938 --> 00:05:19.357
you have packed too light.

00:05:19.899 --> 00:05:20.900
So feel proud,

00:05:20.900 --> 00:05:21.901
feel uplifted,

00:05:21.901 --> 00:05:24.445
feel accomplished
in your commitment to equity,

00:05:24.445 --> 00:05:26.989
but also feel like
you have more work to do

00:05:26.989 --> 00:05:28.449
because lifting --

00:05:28.449 --> 00:05:29.450
it’s difficult.